{
  "case": "surface-direct-edit-when",
  "clause": "DESIGN R3.3 \u00a78.3 L649 direct edit evaluates the same ui.when; \u00a78.3 L657 keyboard and direct edit share the canonical surface",
  "derivation": "task-label (typeIs bpmn:Task and name != Fixed) is listed for Task_1 and hidden for Task_2 (named Fixed). The call on Task_2 is refused profile-producer with no change; the authorized call on Task_1 renames it to Checked (one accepted batch). The accepted report has no entry: C writes nothing (isExecutable already false), every bpmn:Task keeps a nonempty name so neither draft subrule finds anything, and the 26 standard rules are off.",
